    <detaileddescription>
<para>That is an arbitrary struct of which the first field is a pointer to an <ref refid="structAVClass" kindref="compound">AVClass</ref> struct (e.g. <ref refid="structAVCodecContext" kindref="compound">AVCodecContext</ref>, <ref refid="structAVFormatContext" kindref="compound">AVFormatContext</ref> etc.). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
